            "review_title": "Review at Quan Chay Quan Am",
            "review_text": "Khac-Quan N\nSan Jose, California123 contributions\n0\nGreat food and beautiful decor\nJan 2020\nI was lucky enough to meet the owner and the architect of this beautiful restaurant. \nThe collection of the our meal that day was picked by him and of course they were all the best. Their portion, to me, is in good amount and not too small , so don't order too much as we did :) Make sure to visit the back yard with this beautiful decor and the pond. The location is kind of hard to find or even get taxi afterward, so make sure you would go with a local friend or ask help from the restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2020",
